Câu hỏi: What are classes in ES6
Trả lời: In ES6, JavaScript classes are primarily syntactic sugar over JavaScript’s existing prototype-based inheritance.

    Whereas ES6 classes can be defined as an alternative

    ```javascript
    class Bike {
      constructor(color, model) {
        this.color = color;
        this.model = model;
      }

      getDetails() {
        return this.model + " bike has" + this.color + " color";
      }
    }
    ```

