Câu hỏi: What is the purpose of the delete operator
Trả lời: The delete operator is used to delete the property as well as its value.

    ```javascript
    var user = { firstName: "John", lastName: "Doe", age: 20 };
    delete user.age;

    console.log(user); // {firstName: "John", lastName:"Doe"}
    ```

