Câu hỏi: How do you parse JSON string
Trả lời: When receiving the data from a web server, the data is always in a string format. But you can convert this string value to a javascript object using parse() method.

      ```javascript
      var userString = '{"name":"John","age":31}';
      var userJSON = JSON.parse(userString);
      console.log(userJSON); // {name: "John", age: 31}
