Câu hỏi: How do you get the image width and height using JS
Trả lời: You can programmatically get the image and check the dimensions(width and height) using JavaScript.

      ```javascript
      var img = new Image();
      img.onload = function () {
        console.log(this.width + "x" + this.height);
      };
      img.src = "http://www.google.com/intl/en_ALL/images/logo.gif";
